  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3300.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3308.04 Fuel Supplier Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3308.04 Fuel Supplier Requirements. A large MWC facility combusting PWR shall obtain PWR only from suppliers that:\n\n(a) Produce PWR in compliance with all requirements of 40 CFR 241.4(a)(5) and this part;\n\n(b) Collect 3 random representative grab samples for each 250 tons of PWR produced, which shall be composited into a single well mixed sample for each 1000 tons of PWR produced;\n\n(c) Have the composite sample analyzed as specified in Env-A 3308.06; and\n\n(d) Pass an independent third-party inspection in accordance with Env-A 3308.05 prior to November 15th of each year in which PWR will be offered to a large MWC facility for combustion.\n\nSource. #12628, eff 9-27-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3300.html"
